  "notes": [
    "Every path below must match FontRegistry.catalog in lib/src/domain/services/font_registry.dart; test/fonts/font_asset_manifest_test.dart enforces that.",
    "sha256 is null in the repository on purpose: no one may invent a hash. run `sh tool/fetch_fonts.sh` to download the upstream files, record their hashes here, and then `sh tool/verify_fonts.sh` to prove the bytes are real fonts.",
    "A non-null sha256 makes the fetch reproducible: tool/fetch_fonts.sh refuses to install a file whose bytes differ from the recorded hash, so silent upstream re-releases (or a corrupted download) fail loudly."
